# Extensão REST Client do VS Code.
# Para testar outra API, troque só a porta:
# 8001 = Python | 8002 = Node | 8003 = Go | 8004 = Rust
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8001

### Criar
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Silva", "email": "ana@exemplo.com", "birthday": "2000-05-15", "cpf": "12345678901" }

### Listar
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Buscar
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1

### Substituir
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana Souza", "email": "ana@exemplo.com", "birthday": "2000-05-15", "cpf": "12345678901" }

### Atualizar parcial
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana S. Souza" }

### Remover
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/1

### --- Erros ---

### 400: campo inválido
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ana", "email": "invalido", "birthday": "2000-05-15", "cpf": "12345678901" }

### 400: JSON inválido
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name":

### 400: id inválido
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/abc

### 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/999999
